  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 Initial Stable Release:\n\t\t\t- Launched ModernTextBox with Standard, Search, and Password modes.\n\t\t\t- Included interactive inline GDI+ icons (Search Glass, Password Eye, Clear Button).\n\t\t\t- Implemented native Dark/Light mode integration with 5 Podargus design styles.\n\t\t\t- Built-in placeholder/watermark text without Win32 interop hacks.\n\t\t\t- High-DPI support and anti-aliased glowing focus borders.",
